{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124634","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124634/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124634/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124634/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124634","id":5920416827,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYOJkOw","number":124634,"title":"Pow function in .gdshader does not support vec and float together","user":{"login":"MarsAstro","id":16353107,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzUzMTA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16353107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro","html_url":"https://github.com/MarsAstro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-10-19T08:24:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:52:17Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T20:47:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.7.1\n4.7.2\n4.8 beta 1\n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe pow function in Godots shader language does not support mixing a vector type with a float type\nThis does not follow the matching GLSL specification\n\nYou can circumvent the issue by for example raising a vector to the power of a same sized vector where every component is equal to the float you want to raise the main vector to. It's more cumbersome though, and shouldn't be necessary. Given that raising to 2.2 is a common way to shift color space in fragment shader, and raising vectors to the power of a float in general is something one does a lot in shader code, this is a part of GLSL that should be implemented. \n\nTo summarize:\n\n```\nvec3 color = pow(someVec3, vec3(2.2)); // Works fine, raises someVec3 to the power of 2.2\nvec3 color = pow(someVec3, 2.2); // Does not work, but should work the same as above example\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create new .gdshader\n2. In the fragment shader write this line of code:\n`vec3 color = pow(vec3(1.0), 2.0);`\n3. Editor claims (vec3, float) are invalid types\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[shader-error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33651899/shader-error.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"MarsAstro","id":16353107,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzUzMTA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16353107?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro","html_url":"https://github.com/MarsAstro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarsAstro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124634/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124634/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}